  "notes": "{譴責|けんせき} is a formal word for official reprimand or censure. The kanji {譴|けん} means \"to blame\" or \"censure.\"\n\nUsage:\n- {譴責|けんせき}する (to reprimand, censure)\n- {譴責|けんせき}を{受|う}ける (to receive a reprimand)\n- {譴責|けんせき}{処分|しょぶん} (disciplinary censure)\n\nContexts:\n- Workplace discipline\n- Professional associations\n- Parliamentary/political censure\n- Military discipline\n\nRelated words:\n- {叱責|しっせき}: scolding, reprimand (more common)\n- {戒告|かいこく}: admonition, warning\n- {訓戒|くんかい}: admonition, caution\n- {非難|ひなん}: criticism, blame",
